Open IEM Debian package

Install:
  sudo apt install ./openiem_VERSION_ARCH.deb

Upgrade preserves /etc/openiem and /var/lib/openiem.
Uninstall removes package-managed binaries and unit.
Purge additionally removes /var/lib/openiem and /etc/openiem only through explicit dpkg purge.

Package gates are software evidence. Physical Raspberry Pi/audio certification remains separate.
